{"id":"d3ca3f7c6346efe2","group":"FormalSystem","path":"FormalSystem/901_First-degree_Entailment_FDE.md","title":"901 First-degree Entailment FDE","display":"901_First-degree_Entailment_FDE","type":"system","metadata":{},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[],"html":"<h1 id=\"901-First-degree-Entailment-FDE\">901 First-degree Entailment FDE</h1>\n<p><span class=\"inline-tag\">#FormalSystem</span></p>\n<h1 id=\"1.-原始符号\">1. 原始符号</h1>\n<p>令 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{At}\">\\(\\mathsf{At}\\)</span> 为固定可数无限命题原子集合。公式构造子为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{atm},\\operatorname{neg},\\operatorname{and},\\operatorname{or}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{atm},\\operatorname{neg},\\operatorname{and},\\operatorname{or}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>第 2 节定义 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Frm}\">\\(\\mathsf{Frm}\\)</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{atm},\\operatorname{neg},\\operatorname{and},\\operatorname{or}\">\\(\\operatorname{atm},\\operatorname{neg},\\operatorname{and},\\operatorname{or}\\)</span> 四个构造子生成的最小闭包。其型别为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{atm}:\\mathsf{At}\\to\\mathsf{Frm},\n\\qquad\n\\operatorname{neg}:\\mathsf{Frm}\\to\\mathsf{Frm},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{atm}:\\mathsf{At}\\to\\mathsf{Frm},\n\\qquad\n\\operatorname{neg}:\\mathsf{Frm}\\to\\mathsf{Frm},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{and},\\operatorname{or}:\n\\mathsf{Frm}\\times\\mathsf{Frm}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{and},\\operatorname{or}:\n\\mathsf{Frm}\\times\\mathsf{Frm}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>FDE 的目标特征是只定义一阶蕴涵层级的四值语义后承；对象语言没有蕴含构造子。</p>\n<h1 id=\"2.-公式与替换\">2. 公式与替换</h1>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Frm}\">\\(\\mathsf{Frm}\\)</span> 是满足下列条件的最小集合：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"p\\in\\mathsf{At}\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{atm}(p)\\in\\mathsf{Frm},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[p\\in\\mathsf{At}\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{atm}(p)\\in\\mathsf{Frm},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{neg}(A)\\in\\mathsf{Frm},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{neg}(A)\\in\\mathsf{Frm},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{and}(A,B)\\in\\mathsf{Frm},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{and}(A,B)\\in\\mathsf{Frm},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{or}(A,B)\\in\\mathsf{Frm}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{or}(A,B)\\in\\mathsf{Frm}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>定义 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}:\\mathsf{Frm}\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathsf{At})\">\\(\\operatorname{FV}:\\mathsf{Frm}\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathsf{At})\\)</span>：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}(\\operatorname{atm}(p))=\\{p\\},\\quad\n\\operatorname{FV}(\\operatorname{neg}(A))=\\operatorname{FV}(A),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FV}(\\operatorname{atm}(p))=\\{p\\},\\quad\n\\operatorname{FV}(\\operatorname{neg}(A))=\\operatorname{FV}(A),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}(\\operatorname{and}(A,B))=\\operatorname{FV}(\\operatorname{or}(A,B))=\\operatorname{FV}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}(B).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FV}(\\operatorname{and}(A,B))=\\operatorname{FV}(\\operatorname{or}(A,B))=\\operatorname{FV}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}(B).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sigma:\\mathsf{At}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}\">\\(\\sigma:\\mathsf{At}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}\\)</span>，定义</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Sub}:\\mathsf{Frm}\\times\\mathsf{Frm}^{\\mathsf{At}}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Sub}:\\mathsf{Frm}\\times\\mathsf{Frm}^{\\mathsf{At}}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A[\\sigma]\">\\(A[\\sigma]\\)</span>：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{atm}(p)[\\sigma]=\\sigma(p),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{atm}(p)[\\sigma]=\\sigma(p),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{neg}(A)[\\sigma]=\\operatorname{neg}(A[\\sigma]),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{neg}(A)[\\sigma]=\\operatorname{neg}(A[\\sigma]),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{and}(A,B)[\\sigma]=\\operatorname{and}(A[\\sigma],B[\\sigma]),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{and}(A,B)[\\sigma]=\\operatorname{and}(A[\\sigma],B[\\sigma]),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{or}(A,B)[\\sigma]=\\operatorname{or}(A[\\sigma],B[\\sigma]).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{or}(A,B)[\\sigma]=\\operatorname{or}(A[\\sigma],B[\\sigma]).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>该语言没有绑定构造子。定义有限原子集、绑定名函数与新原子选择函数：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{At})=\\{F\\subseteq\\mathsf{At}:F\\text{ 为有限集}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{At})=\\{F\\subseteq\\mathsf{At}:F\\text{ 为有限集}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{BN}:\\mathsf{Frm}\\to\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{At}),\n\\qquad\n\\operatorname{BN}(A)=\\varnothing.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{BN}:\\mathsf{Frm}\\to\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{At}),\n\\qquad\n\\operatorname{BN}(A)=\\varnothing.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{freshAt}:\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{At})\\to\\mathsf{At},\n\\qquad\n\\operatorname{freshAt}(F)\\notin F.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{freshAt}:\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{At})\\to\\mathsf{At},\n\\qquad\n\\operatorname{freshAt}(F)\\notin F.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>对任一原子重命名 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\rho:\\mathsf{At}\\to\\mathsf{At}\">\\(\\rho:\\mathsf{At}\\to\\mathsf{At}\\)</span>，令</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Ren}_{\\mathsf{FDE}}:\\mathsf{Frm}\\times\\mathsf{At}^{\\mathsf{At}}\\to\\mathsf{Frm},\n\\qquad\n\\operatorname{Ren}_{\\mathsf{FDE}}(A,\\rho)=A[\\sigma_\\rho],\n\\qquad\n\\sigma_\\rho(p)=\\operatorname{atm}(\\rho(p)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Ren}_{\\mathsf{FDE}}:\\mathsf{Frm}\\times\\mathsf{At}^{\\mathsf{At}}\\to\\mathsf{Frm},\n\\qquad\n\\operatorname{Ren}_{\\mathsf{FDE}}(A,\\rho)=A[\\sigma_\\rho],\n\\qquad\n\\sigma_\\rho(p)=\\operatorname{atm}(\\rho(p)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>定义 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha\">\\(\\alpha\\)</span>-等价为句法相等：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"A\\equiv_\\alpha^{\\mathsf{FDE}}B\\Longleftrightarrow A=B.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[A\\equiv_\\alpha^{\\mathsf{FDE}}B\\Longleftrightarrow A=B.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>因此 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Sub}\">\\(\\operatorname{Sub}\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Ren}_{\\mathsf{FDE}}\">\\(\\operatorname{Ren}_{\\mathsf{FDE}}\\)</span> 均是捕获避免替换。</p>\n<h1 id=\"3.-四值结构\">3. 四值结构</h1>\n<p>令</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Val}=\\mathcal P(\\{\\mathsf t,\\mathsf f\\}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Val}=\\mathcal P(\\{\\mathsf t,\\mathsf f\\}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>指定值集合为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Des}=\\{v\\in\\mathsf{Val}:\\mathsf t\\in v\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Des}=\\{v\\in\\mathsf{Val}:\\mathsf t\\in v\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>定义四值运算：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{nval}(v)=\\{\\mathsf t:\\mathsf f\\in v\\}\\cup\\{\\mathsf f:\\mathsf t\\in v\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{nval}(v)=\\{\\mathsf t:\\mathsf f\\in v\\}\\cup\\{\\mathsf f:\\mathsf t\\in v\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{aval}(u,v)=\\{\\mathsf t:\\mathsf t\\in u\\land\\mathsf t\\in v\\}\\cup\\{\\mathsf f:\\mathsf f\\in u\\lor\\mathsf f\\in v\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{aval}(u,v)=\\{\\mathsf t:\\mathsf t\\in u\\land\\mathsf t\\in v\\}\\cup\\{\\mathsf f:\\mathsf f\\in u\\lor\\mathsf f\\in v\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{oval}(u,v)=\\{\\mathsf t:\\mathsf t\\in u\\lor\\mathsf t\\in v\\}\\cup\\{\\mathsf f:\\mathsf f\\in u\\land\\mathsf f\\in v\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{oval}(u,v)=\\{\\mathsf t:\\mathsf t\\in u\\lor\\mathsf t\\in v\\}\\cup\\{\\mathsf f:\\mathsf f\\in u\\land\\mathsf f\\in v\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"4.-赋值\">4. 赋值</h1>\n<p>赋值集合为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Valuation}_{\\mathsf{FDE}}=\\mathsf{Val}^{\\mathsf{At}}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Valuation}_{\\mathsf{FDE}}=\\mathsf{Val}^{\\mathsf{At}}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\nu\\in\\mathsf{Valuation}_{\\mathsf{FDE}}\">\\(\\nu\\in\\mathsf{Valuation}_{\\mathsf{FDE}}\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\nu:\\mathsf{At}\\to\\mathsf{Val}\">\\(\\nu:\\mathsf{At}\\to\\mathsf{Val}\\)</span>。</p>\n<h1 id=\"5.-解释函数\">5. 解释函数</h1>\n<p>解释函数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\llbracket-\\rrbracket_\\nu:\\mathsf{Frm}\\to\\mathsf{Val}\">\\(\\llbracket-\\rrbracket_\\nu:\\mathsf{Frm}\\to\\mathsf{Val}\\)</span> 定义为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\llbracket\\operatorname{atm}(p)\\rrbracket_\\nu=\\nu(p),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\llbracket\\operatorname{atm}(p)\\rrbracket_\\nu=\\nu(p),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\llbracket\\operatorname{neg}(A)\\rrbracket_\\nu=\\operatorname{nval}(\\llbracket A\\rrbracket_\\nu),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\llbracket\\operatorname{neg}(A)\\rrbracket_\\nu=\\operatorname{nval}(\\llbracket A\\rrbracket_\\nu),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\llbracket\\operatorname{and}(A,B)\\rrbracket_\\nu=\\operatorname{aval}(\\llbracket A\\rrbracket_\\nu,\\llbracket B\\rrbracket_\\nu),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\llbracket\\operatorname{and}(A,B)\\rrbracket_\\nu=\\operatorname{aval}(\\llbracket A\\rrbracket_\\nu,\\llbracket B\\rrbracket_\\nu),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\llbracket\\operatorname{or}(A,B)\\rrbracket_\\nu=\\operatorname{oval}(\\llbracket A\\rrbracket_\\nu,\\llbracket B\\rrbracket_\\nu).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\llbracket\\operatorname{or}(A,B)\\rrbracket_\\nu=\\operatorname{oval}(\\llbracket A\\rrbracket_\\nu,\\llbracket B\\rrbracket_\\nu).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"6.-后承关系\">6. 后承关系</h1>\n<p>定义</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\models_{\\mathsf{FDE}}A\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall\\nu\\in\\mathsf{Valuation}_{\\mathsf{FDE}}\\,\n\\bigl((\\forall B\\in\\Gamma\\,\\llbracket B\\rrbracket_\\nu\\in\\mathsf{Des})\\to\n\\llbracket A\\rrbracket_\\nu\\in\\mathsf{Des}\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Gamma\\models_{\\mathsf{FDE}}A\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall\\nu\\in\\mathsf{Valuation}_{\\mathsf{FDE}}\\,\n\\bigl((\\forall B\\in\\Gamma\\,\\llbracket B\\rrbracket_\\nu\\in\\mathsf{Des})\\to\n\\llbracket A\\rrbracket_\\nu\\in\\mathsf{Des}\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"7.-反例证书\">7. 反例证书</h1>\n<p>定义反例证书集合：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Cex}_{\\mathsf{FDE}}(\\Gamma,A)=\n\\{(\\Gamma,A,\\nu):\\nu\\in\\mathsf{Valuation}_{\\mathsf{FDE}},\\forall B\\in\\Gamma\\,\\llbracket B\\rrbracket_\\nu\\in\\mathsf{Des},\\llbracket A\\rrbracket_\\nu\\notin\\mathsf{Des}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Cex}_{\\mathsf{FDE}}(\\Gamma,A)=\n\\{(\\Gamma,A,\\nu):\\nu\\in\\mathsf{Valuation}_{\\mathsf{FDE}},\\forall B\\in\\Gamma\\,\\llbracket B\\rrbracket_\\nu\\in\\mathsf{Des},\\llbracket A\\rrbracket_\\nu\\notin\\mathsf{Des}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>于是</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\not\\models_{\\mathsf{FDE}}A\\Longleftrightarrow \\mathsf{Cex}_{\\mathsf{FDE}}(\\Gamma,A)\\ne\\varnothing.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Gamma\\not\\models_{\\mathsf{FDE}}A\\Longleftrightarrow \\mathsf{Cex}_{\\mathsf{FDE}}(\\Gamma,A)\\ne\\varnothing.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>本条目选择纯语义实现，不把有效性包装成有限证明证书。定义有效判断集合</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Valid}_{\\mathsf{FDE}}\n=\n\\{(\\Gamma,A)\\in\\mathcal P(\\mathsf{Frm})\\times\\mathsf{Frm}:\n\\Gamma\\models_{\\mathsf{FDE}}A\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Valid}_{\\mathsf{FDE}}\n=\n\\{(\\Gamma,A)\\in\\mathcal P(\\mathsf{Frm})\\times\\mathsf{Frm}:\n\\Gamma\\models_{\\mathsf{FDE}}A\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>于是</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"(\\Gamma,A)\\in\\mathsf{Valid}_{\\mathsf{FDE}}\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\mathsf{Cex}_{\\mathsf{FDE}}(\\Gamma,A)=\\varnothing.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[(\\Gamma,A)\\in\\mathsf{Valid}_{\\mathsf{FDE}}\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\mathsf{Cex}_{\\mathsf{FDE}}(\\Gamma,A)=\\varnothing.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>FDE 的语义差异对象为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Delta}_{\\mathsf{FDE}}\n=(\\mathsf{Val},\\mathsf{Des},\\operatorname{nval},\\operatorname{aval},\n\\operatorname{oval},\\mathsf{Valuation}_{\\mathsf{FDE}},\n\\models_{\\mathsf{FDE}},\\mathsf{Cex}_{\\mathsf{FDE}}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Delta}_{\\mathsf{FDE}}\n=(\\mathsf{Val},\\mathsf{Des},\\operatorname{nval},\\operatorname{aval},\n\\operatorname{oval},\\mathsf{Valuation}_{\\mathsf{FDE}},\n\\models_{\\mathsf{FDE}},\\mathsf{Cex}_{\\mathsf{FDE}}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"8.-整个形式系统\">8. 整个形式系统</h1>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal S_{\\mathsf{FDE}}=(\\mathsf{At},\\mathsf{Frm},\\operatorname{FV},\\operatorname{Sub},\\operatorname{BN},\\operatorname{freshAt},\\operatorname{Ren}_{\\mathsf{FDE}},\\equiv_\\alpha^{\\mathsf{FDE}},\\mathsf{Val},\\mathsf{Des},\\operatorname{nval},\\operatorname{aval},\\operatorname{oval},\\mathsf{Valuation}_{\\mathsf{FDE}},\\llbracket-\\rrbracket,\\models_{\\mathsf{FDE}},\\mathsf{Cex}_{\\mathsf{FDE}},\\mathsf{Valid}_{\\mathsf{FDE}},\\mathsf{Delta}_{\\mathsf{FDE}}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal S_{\\mathsf{FDE}}=(\\mathsf{At},\\mathsf{Frm},\\operatorname{FV},\\operatorname{Sub},\\operatorname{BN},\\operatorname{freshAt},\\operatorname{Ren}_{\\mathsf{FDE}},\\equiv_\\alpha^{\\mathsf{FDE}},\\mathsf{Val},\\mathsf{Des},\\operatorname{nval},\\operatorname{aval},\\operatorname{oval},\\mathsf{Valuation}_{\\mathsf{FDE}},\\llbracket-\\rrbracket,\\models_{\\mathsf{FDE}},\\mathsf{Cex}_{\\mathsf{FDE}},\\mathsf{Valid}_{\\mathsf{FDE}},\\mathsf{Delta}_{\\mathsf{FDE}}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>该系统只定义 FDE 的四值语义后承；不含蕴含连接词、证明演算或完备性定理。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"901-First-degree-Entailment-FDE","text":"901 First-degree Entailment FDE","level":1},{"id":"1.-原始符号","text":"1. 原始符号","level":1},{"id":"2.-公式与替换","text":"2. 公式与替换","level":1},{"id":"3.-四值结构","text":"3. 四值结构","level":1},{"id":"4.-赋值","text":"4. 赋值","level":1},{"id":"5.-解释函数","text":"5. 解释函数","level":1},{"id":"6.-后承关系","text":"6. 后承关系","level":1},{"id":"7.-反例证书","text":"7. 反例证书","level":1},{"id":"8.-整个形式系统","text":"8. 整个形式系统","level":1}],"links":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathsf{At}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{atm},\\operatorname{neg},\\operatorname{and},\\operatorname{or}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathsf{Frm}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{atm},\\operatorname{neg},\\operatorname{and},\\operatorname{or}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{atm}:\\mathsf{At}\\to\\mathsf{Frm},\n\\qquad\n\\operatorname{neg}:\\mathsf{Frm}\\to\\mathsf{Frm},","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{and},\\operatorname{or}:\n\\mathsf{Frm}\\times\\mathsf{Frm}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathsf{Frm}","display":false},{"tex":"p\\in\\mathsf{At}\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{atm}(p)\\in\\mathsf{Frm},","display":true},{"tex":"A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{neg}(A)\\in\\mathsf{Frm},","display":true},{"tex":"A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{and}(A,B)\\in\\mathsf{Frm},","display":true},{"tex":"A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{or}(A,B)\\in\\mathsf{Frm}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{FV}:\\mathsf{Frm}\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathsf{At})","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{FV}(\\operatorname{atm}(p))=\\{p\\},\\quad\n\\operatorname{FV}(\\operatorname{neg}(A))=\\operatorname{FV}(A),","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{FV}(\\operatorname{and}(A,B))=\\operatorname{FV}(\\operatorname{or}(A,B))=\\operatorname{FV}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}(B).","display":true},{"tex":"\\sigma:\\mathsf{At}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Sub}:\\mathsf{Frm}\\times\\mathsf{Frm}^{\\mathsf{At}}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}","display":true},{"tex":"A[\\sigma]","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{atm}(p)[\\sigma]=\\sigma(p),","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{neg}(A)[\\sigma]=\\operatorname{neg}(A[\\sigma]),","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{and}(A,B)[\\sigma]=\\operatorname{and}(A[\\sigma],B[\\sigma]),","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{or}(A,B)[\\sigma]=\\operatorname{or}(A[\\sigma],B[\\sigma]).","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{At})=\\{F\\subseteq\\mathsf{At}:F\\text{ 为有限集}\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{BN}:\\mathsf{Frm}\\to\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{At}),\n\\qquad\n\\operatorname{BN}(A)=\\varnothing.","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{freshAt}:\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{At})\\to\\mathsf{At},\n\\qquad\n\\operatorname{freshAt}(F)\\notin F.","display":true},{"tex":"\\rho:\\mathsf{At}\\to\\mathsf{At}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Ren}_{\\mathsf{FDE}}:\\mathsf{Frm}\\times\\mathsf{At}^{\\mathsf{At}}\\to\\mathsf{Frm},\n\\qquad\n\\operatorname{Ren}_{\\mathsf{FDE}}(A,\\rho)=A[\\sigma_\\rho],\n\\qquad\n\\sigma_\\rho(p)=\\operatorname{atm}(\\rho(p)).","display":true},{"tex":"\\alpha","display":false},{"tex":"A\\equiv_\\alpha^{\\mathsf{FDE}}B\\Longleftrightarrow A=B.","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Sub}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Ren}_{\\mathsf{FDE}}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{Val}=\\mathcal P(\\{\\mathsf t,\\mathsf f\\}).","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathsf{Des}=\\{v\\in\\mathsf{Val}:\\mathsf t\\in v\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{nval}(v)=\\{\\mathsf t:\\mathsf f\\in v\\}\\cup\\{\\mathsf f:\\mathsf t\\in v\\},","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{aval}(u,v)=\\{\\mathsf t:\\mathsf t\\in u\\land\\mathsf t\\in v\\}\\cup\\{\\mathsf f:\\mathsf f\\in u\\lor\\mathsf f\\in v\\},","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{oval}(u,v)=\\{\\mathsf t:\\mathsf t\\in u\\lor\\mathsf t\\in v\\}\\cup\\{\\mathsf f:\\mathsf f\\in u\\land\\mathsf f\\in v\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathsf{Valuation}_{\\mathsf{FDE}}=\\mathsf{Val}^{\\mathsf{At}}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\nu\\in\\mathsf{Valuation}_{\\mathsf{FDE}}","display":false},{"tex":"\\nu:\\mathsf{At}\\to\\mathsf{Val}","display":false},{"tex":"\\llbracket-\\rrbracket_\\nu:\\mathsf{Frm}\\to\\mathsf{Val}","display":false},{"tex":"\\llbracket\\operatorname{atm}(p)\\rrbracket_\\nu=\\nu(p),","display":true},{"tex":"\\llbracket\\operatorname{neg}(A)\\rrbracket_\\nu=\\operatorname{nval}(\\llbracket A\\rrbracket_\\nu),","display":true},{"tex":"\\llbracket\\operatorname{and}(A,B)\\rrbracket_\\nu=\\operatorname{aval}(\\llbracket A\\rrbracket_\\nu,\\llbracket B\\rrbracket_\\nu),","display":true},{"tex":"\\llbracket\\operatorname{or}(A,B)\\rrbracket_\\nu=\\operatorname{oval}(\\llbracket A\\rrbracket_\\nu,\\llbracket B\\rrbracket_\\nu).","display":true},{"tex":"\\Gamma\\models_{\\mathsf{FDE}}A\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall\\nu\\in\\mathsf{Valuation}_{\\mathsf{FDE}}\\,\n\\bigl((\\forall B\\in\\Gamma\\,\\llbracket B\\rrbracket_\\nu\\in\\mathsf{Des})\\to\n\\llbracket A\\rrbracket_\\nu\\in\\mathsf{Des}\\bigr).","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathsf{Cex}_{\\mathsf{FDE}}(\\Gamma,A)=\n\\{(\\Gamma,A,\\nu):\\nu\\in\\mathsf{Valuation}_{\\mathsf{FDE}},\\forall B\\in\\Gamma\\,\\llbracket B\\rrbracket_\\nu\\in\\mathsf{Des},\\llbracket A\\rrbracket_\\nu\\notin\\mathsf{Des}\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\Gamma\\not\\models_{\\mathsf{FDE}}A\\Longleftrightarrow \\mathsf{Cex}_{\\mathsf{FDE}}(\\Gamma,A)\\ne\\varnothing.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathsf{Valid}_{\\mathsf{FDE}}\n=\n\\{(\\Gamma,A)\\in\\mathcal P(\\mathsf{Frm})\\times\\mathsf{Frm}:\n\\Gamma\\models_{\\mathsf{FDE}}A\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"(\\Gamma,A)\\in\\mathsf{Valid}_{\\mathsf{FDE}}\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\mathsf{Cex}_{\\mathsf{FDE}}(\\Gamma,A)=\\varnothing.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathsf{Delta}_{\\mathsf{FDE}}\n=(\\mathsf{Val},\\mathsf{Des},\\operatorname{nval},\\operatorname{aval},\n\\operatorname{oval},\\mathsf{Valuation}_{\\mathsf{FDE}},\n\\models_{\\mathsf{FDE}},\\mathsf{Cex}_{\\mathsf{FDE}}).","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathcal S_{\\mathsf{FDE}}=(\\mathsf{At},\\mathsf{Frm},\\operatorname{FV},\\operatorname{Sub},\\operatorname{BN},\\operatorname{freshAt},\\operatorname{Ren}_{\\mathsf{FDE}},\\equiv_\\alpha^{\\mathsf{FDE}},\\mathsf{Val},\\mathsf{Des},\\operatorname{nval},\\operatorname{aval},\\operatorname{oval},\\mathsf{Valuation}_{\\mathsf{FDE}},\\llbracket-\\rrbracket,\\models_{\\mathsf{FDE}},\\mathsf{Cex}_{\\mathsf{FDE}},\\mathsf{Valid}_{\\mathsf{FDE}},\\mathsf{Delta}_{\\mathsf{FDE}}).","display":true}],"bytes":5801,"backlinks":[],"outgoing":[]}